messages:
Sam: Proposal: split the large structured-output doc into two focused PRs to make reviews faster. PR 1 = JSON Schema + compact canonical examples. PR 2 = parsing playbook + SDK snippets + fallback heuristics. I'll open both and assign owners.

Lina: I can take PR1 (schema + examples). I'll add a tiny AJV snippet and two minimal examples for nullable arrays and wrapped unions. Planning to move examples to docs/schemas/ so sidebar is clean.

Arjun: I'll take PR2 (parsing + SDK). I'll add a short SDK 4.x tryParse envelope snippet, a minimal regex fallback example, and a note about safety (no regex for PII). Keep code tiny and copy-paste safe.

Priya: I'll run a link sweep and prepare redirects for any moved paths. If schema PR lands first, please wait for my redirect PR to avoid broken links on main.

LinkBot: Reminder: run docs link-checker and add the label 'migration-notes' if user-facing examples change shapes. Also check fenced code block language tags.

Sam: Timeline: drafts tomorrow, land both by Friday. Keep snippets <12 lines and add one-line SDK 3.x -> 4.x migration blurb in descriptions.

Lina: PR1 opened: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/10001 — moved examples and added frontmatter. Left TODO to add the AJV strict-mode snippet.

Arjun: PR2 draft up: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/10002. Included parse fallback example:```js
// SDK 4.x minimal parse fallback
try {
  return JSON.parse(text);
} catch (e) {
  const m = /"result"\s*:\s*"([^\"]+)"/.exec(text);
  return m ? {result: m[1]} : {raw: text, parseError: true};
}
```

Priya: Redirect PR opened: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/10003 with sidebar updates and redirect map.

Sam: Reviewed PR1, small style nits. Lina, can you run prettier on the examples?

Lina: Fixed lint nits and pushed. Merged PR1 after CI passed.

Arjun: Addressed wording and merged PR2. Added the SDK migration blurb comparing 3.x function-calling payloads to 4.x structured envelopes.

Priya: Merged redirects and updated the release-notes draft with: "Docs: split structured-output guidance into schema and parsing sections; added SDK 4.x parsing fallback examples and redirects."

Sam: Thanks everyone. Closing thread. :tada:
